# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# COOP/COEP are what make `crossOriginIsolated` (hence `SharedArrayBuffer`, hence
# site/pkg-threaded) available at all; they also cost nothing and enable fine
# timers for the serial lane.
#
# CSP connect-src: 'self' plus the Hugging Face weight CDN, and NOTHING else.
# Model weights are fetched straight from Hugging Face so multi-gigabyte
# downloads do not cross this site's bandwidth; `*.hf.co` is required because
# huggingface.co 302s to a region-specific CDN host (us.aws.cdn.hf.co and
# friends). That is a real, deliberate weakening of the old `connect-src 'self'`
# — it is now "the page may talk to the weight CDN", not "the page may talk to
# nobody". What it still enforces is the part that matters: those are the ONLY
# origins reachable, the traffic to them is one-way downloads of public
# hash-pinned files, and there is no origin the page could POST a document to.
# The page copy says exactly this; keep the two in step.
# 'wasm-unsafe-eval' is required for WebAssembly.compileStreaming;
# 'unsafe-eval' rides along because Safari only learned the wasm token in 16.4.
# worker-src needs blob: for the threaded lane: wasm-bindgen-rayon's no-bundler
# helper self-spawns each rayon worker from a blob URL of its own script (so the
# module still works when served from a CDN origin). Without blob: the pool
# silently fails to arm.
#
# Cache-control: every hand-written script is listed LITERALLY with no-cache
# (Pages splats must end a pattern); the @SITEV@ stamp in every script URL is
# the real freshness mechanism — a CDN zone TTL override can ignore origin
# no-cache, and did, on the sibling project.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-eval'; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://huggingface.co https://*.hf.co; media-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/app.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/chrome.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/viz.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/engine-worker.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/loader.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/model-manifest.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/reset.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/pkg/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/pkg-threaded/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/model/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
